  "nodes": [
    {
      "uid": "730cc03c23da7af506dc3ac079e9b377",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "type": "dlg.say",
      "data": {
        "actor": {
          "guid": "fa5f23fcade604644aa3dcb3909d2e87",
          "name": "Voyager1"
        },
        "text": {
          "ru": "Это всё, что я собрал. Сторона Б. Часть дорожек осталась пустой — я подписал их именами.",
          "en": "This is everything I collected. Side B. Some of the tracks stayed empty — I signed those with names."
        }
      },
      "out": [
        {
          "uid": "0baa2d9e6d78f3a54d8a9a173b8e8077",
          "target": "ed9e65410c5713d60f069be472d028e6"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "ed9e65410c5713d60f069be472d028e6",
      "position": [
        0,
        140
      ],
      "type": "dlg.say",
      "data": {
        "actor": {
          "guid": "fa5f23fcade604644aa3dcb3909d2e87",
          "name": "Voyager1"
        },
        "text": {
          "ru": "Инструкции, как это слушать, я не приложил. Решил, что и так разберутся.",
          "en": "I didn't enclose instructions on how to listen to it. I decided they'd work it out."
        }
      },
      "out": [
        {
          "uid": "ce4bb37d1ed38188832bf50793eff703",
          "target": "b030e4d259caf9d9fe59d2fe6efdd11c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "b030e4d259caf9d9fe59d2fe6efdd11c",
      "position": [
        0,
        280
      ],
      "type": "dlg.say",
      "data": {
        "actor": {
          "guid": "fa5f23fcade604644aa3dcb3909d2e87",
          "name": "Voyager1"
        },
        "text": {
          "ru": "Кто-то же разобрался. Раз ты дослушал до конца.",
          "en": "Somebody did work it out. Since you listened all the way to the end."
        }
      },
      "out": [
        {
          "uid": "fc51272393fe986c1ba4801eafe57689",
          "target": "5b731bfa79f9548d31ba6e4c273219c0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "5b731bfa79f9548d31ba6e4c273219c0",
      "position": [
        0,
        420
      ],
      "type": "dlg.say",
      "data": {
        "actor": {
          "guid": "fa5f23fcade604644aa3dcb3909d2e87",
          "name": "Voyager1"
        },
        "text": {
          "ru": "Спасибо.",
          "en": "Thank you."
        }
      },
      "out": [
        {
          "uid": "316804ec8359d0a804d1db7beeeeef0f",
          "target": "2188a2ad733f1ee145ba03ffa68efc55"
        }
